h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Difficulty</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Medium\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"12\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Bestiary_Level_Medium_2f0084.gif\" width=\"57\"/></span></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"occurrence\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Occurrence</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Common\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"12\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Bestiary_Occurrence_Common_bbcd9e.gif\" width=\"46\"/></span></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"occurrence\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Charm Points</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">25 <span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Charm Icon\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"12\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Charm_Icon_d968ed.gif\" width=\"11\"/></span></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"occurrence\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Kills to Unlock</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">1000</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"attacktype\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Behaviour</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span title=\"Creature attacks in melee range\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img alt=\"Logout Block Icon\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"9\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Logout_Block_Icon_8f2784.gif\" width=\"9\"/></span></span></span> <span title=\"Creature casts spells or uses skills\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img alt=\"Magic Level Icon\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"9\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Magic_Level_Icon_d4433d.png\" width=\"9\"/></span></span></span></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"bestiarylevel\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Soul Core</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Stampor Soul Core\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Stampor_Soul_Core_c627db.gif\" width=\"32\"/></span></span></div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Immunity Properties</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"paraimmune\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Paralysable</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span class=\"no-cross\" title=\"No\">✗</span></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"senseinvis\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Sense Invis</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span class=\"yes-tick\" title=\"Yes\">✓</span></div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Behavioural Properties</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"walksaround\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Walks Around</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img alt=\"Energy Field (Square)\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"19\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Energy_Field_Square_8987b7.gif\" width=\"18\"/></span></span> Energy<br/><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img alt=\"Fire\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"18\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Fire_0ff2ec.gif\" width=\"18\"/></span></span> Fire<br/><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img alt=\"Poison Gas\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"18\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Poison_Gas_c58dd6.gif\" width=\"18\"/></span></span> Poison</div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Other Properties</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"implemented\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Version</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">8.70<br/><span class=\"implementation-date\">December 8, 2010<br/>Winter Update 2010</span></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"status\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Status</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Active</div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<nav class=\"pi-navigation pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-font\">See also: <a href=\"#/wiki/Creatures\">Creatures</a></nav>\n</aside>\n<div id=\"w-twbox-intro\">\n<div id=\"w-item-profile\">\n<div id=\"w-twbox-image\"><img alt=\"latest?cb=20141218233924&amp;path-prefix=en&amp;format=original\" class=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Stampor_b81d53.gif\"/></div>\n<div id=\"w-twbox-look\"><div class=\"creature-look tibiatext tibiagreen\">You see a stampor.</div></div>\n<div class=\"\" id=\"w-twbox-sounds\"><span class=\"tibiatext tibiaorange\"><ul class=\"sound-list\"><li>KRRRRRNG</li></ul></span></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n<div id=\"w-creature-notes\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Notes\">Notes</span></h3>\n<div class=\"webdesc\"><blockquote class=\"webdesc-text\"><p>Scientists have various theories about the nature of the Stampor. Some of them see the Stampor as holy animal of a long forgotten god. Others claim that the Stampor must be some surviving experiment of an ancient and now extinct race. Another faction sees the Stampor as an ordinary animal with a high affinity to the element earth. All of them base their theories on the Stampor's astonishing abilities which nonetheless seem rather natural and not based on magic at all. Be it as it may, the Stampors that have been encountered were quite powerful and often a threat to travellers. This is not caused by an unusual aggressiveness of the Stampor, but rather on their stupidity and bad eyesight. They seem to mistake unknown intruders as members of other Stampor herds which they try to drive off. While a Stampor is very resilient and tough and can easily withstand the 'friendly poking' and spitting, for an ordinary human such friendly warnings can become life-threatening. They seem to be drawn to places aligned to elemental earth in some way and there were sightings of Stampors in areas to which they would be physically unable to travel. Of course this only fuelled rumours and the above mentioned theories, though none of this sightings could be confirmed, yet.</p></blockquote>\n<div class=\"webdesc-from\" style=\"float: right; margin: 0 2em 0 0;\">—Tibia Library</div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n</div>\n<p>Stampors are a tameable creature.<br/>\nYou may hunt <b>600</b> of these as a task of the <a href=\"#/quest/killing-in-the-name-of-quest\">Killing in the Name of... Quest</a>. Upon completion of the task you will face <a href=\"#/wiki/Tromphonyte\">Tromphonyte</a>.\n</p>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n</div>\n<div id=\"w-creature-abilities\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Abilities\">Abilities</span></h3>\n<div class=\"ability_list\"><div class=\"creatureAbility\"><span style=\"white-space: nowrap\"><span class=\"icon\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Physical%20Damage\"><img alt=\"Physical Damage\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"9\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Physical_Damage_Icon_356411.gif\" width=\"9\"/></a></span></span> Melee</span> (0-130)</div>⁠, <div class=\"creatureAbility\"><span style=\"white-space: nowrap\"><span class=\"icon\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Life%20Drain\"><img alt=\"Life Drain\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"9\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Life_Drain_Icon_bda9d3.gif\" width=\"9\"/></a></span></span> <a href=\"#/wiki/Berserk\">Berserk</a></span> (150-280)</div>⁠, <div class=\"creatureAbility\"><span style=\"white-space: nowrap\"><span class=\"icon\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Life%20Drain\"><img alt=\"Life Drain\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"9\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Life_Drain_Icon_bda9d3.gif\" width=\"9\"/></a></span></span> Throws life draining <a href=\"#/wiki/Small%20Stone\">Small Stone</a></span> (75-100)</div>⁠, <div class=\"creatureAbility\"><span style=\"white-space: nowrap\"><span class=\"icon\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span title=\"Healing\"><img alt=\"Healing\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"9\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Healing_Icon_be4df6.gif\" width=\"9\"/></span></span></span> Self-Healing</span> (90-120)</div>⁠, <div class=\"creatureAbility\"><span style=\"white-space: nowrap\"><span class=\"icon\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span title=\"Debuff\"><img alt=\"Debuff\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"9\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Debuff_Icon_73ac6a.gif\" width=\"9\"/></span></span></span> Earth Hit</span> (Reduces Melee and Distance\n by 40% for 18 seconds)</div></div>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"mobile-hide\" id=\"w-creature-resistance-table\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Damage_Taken_From_Elements\">Damage Taken From Elements</span></h3>\n<div id=\"w-creature-resistance-d\">\n<div class=\"creature-resistance-el\" data-value=\"1.0000\" title=\"Physical\"><div class=\"creature-resistance-label\">Physical <span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img alt=\"Bestiary Physical Icon Big\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"16\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Bestiary_Physical_Icon_Big_83da43.gif\" width=\"16\"/></span></span></div><div class=\"creature-resistance-bar1\"><div class=\"creature-resistance-bar2\" style=\"border-width:1px 1px 1px 1px; width:100.0000%; background-color:#ffffff; left:0.0000%;\"></div><div class=\"creature-resistance-pct\" style=\"position:absolute; right:calc(5px + 0.0000%); display:inline-block;\">100%</div></div></div>\n<div class=\"creature-resistance-el\" data-value=\"0.9000\" title=\"Death\"><div class=\"creature-resistance-label\">Death <span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img alt=\"Cursed Icon Big\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"16\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Cursed_Icon_Big_de8a1f.gif\" width=\"16\"/></span></span></div><div class=\"creature-resistance-bar1\"><div class=\"creature-resistance-bar2\" style=\"border-width:1px 1px 1px 1px; width:90.0000%; background-color:#d0bd56; left:0.0000%;\"></div><div class=\"creature-resistance-pct\" style=\"position:absolute; right:calc(5px + 10.0000%); display:inline-block;\">90%</div></div></div>\n<div class=\"creature-resistance-el\" data-value=\"0.5000\" title=\"Holy\"><div class=\"creature-resistance-label\">Holy <span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img alt=\"Dazzled Icon Big\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"16\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Dazzled_Icon_Big_546495.gif\" width=\"16\"/></span></span></div><div class=\"creature-resistance-bar1\"><div class=\"creature-resistance-bar2\" style=\"border-width:1px 1px 1px 1px; width:50.0000%; background-color:#d0bd56; left:0.0000%;\"></div><div class=\"creature-resistance-pct\" style=\"position:absolute; right:calc(5px + 50.0000%); display:inline-block;\">50%</div></div></div>\n<div class=\"creature-resistance-el\" data-value=\"0.9000\" title=\"Ice\"><div class=\"creature-resistance-label\">Ice <span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img alt=\"Freezing Icon Big\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"16\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Freezing_Icon_Big_4dcec8.gif\" width=\"16\"/></span></span></div><div class=\"creature-resistance-bar1\"><div class=\"creature-resistance-bar2\" style=\"border-width:1px 1px 1px 1px; width:90.0000%; background-color:#d0bd56; left:0.0000%;\"></div><div class=\"creature-resistance-pct\" style=\"position:absolute; right:calc(5px + 10.0000%); display:inline-block;\">90%</div></div></div>\n<div class=\"creature-resistance-el\" data-value=\"0.8000\" title=\"Fire\"><div class=\"creature-resistance-label\">Fire <span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img alt=\"Burning Icon Big\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"16\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Burning_Icon_Big_a56686.gif\" width=\"16\"/></span></span></div><div class=\"creature-resistance-bar1\"><div class=\"creature-resistance-bar2\" style=\"border-width:1px 1px 1px 1px; width:80.0000%; background-color:#d0bd56; left:0.0000%;\"></div><div class=\"creature-resistance-pct\" style=\"position:absolute; right:calc(5px + 20.0000%); display:inline-block;\">80%</div></div></div>\n<div class=\"creature-resistance-el\" data-value=\"0.7000\" title=\"Energy\"><div class=\"creature-resistance-label\">Energy <span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img alt=\"Electrified Icon Big\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"16\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Electrified_Icon_Big_b60abe.gif\" width=\"16\"/></span></span></div><div class=\"creature-resistance-bar1\"><div class=\"creature-resistance-bar2\" style=\"border-width:1px 1px 1px 1px; width:70.0000%; background-color:#d0bd56; left:0.0000%;\"></div><div class=\"creature-resistance-pct\" style=\"position:absolute; right:calc(5px + 30.0000%); display:inline-block;\">70%</div></div></div>\n<div class=\"creature-resistance-el\" data-value=\"1.0000\" title=\"Earth\"><div class=\"creature-resistance-label\">Earth <span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img alt=\"Poisoned Icon Big\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"16\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Poisoned_Icon_Big_f04eb1.gif\" width=\"16\"/></span></span></div><div class=\"creature-resistance-bar1\"><div class=\"creature-resistance-bar2\" style=\"border-width:1px 1px 1px 1px; width:100.0000%; background-color:#ffffff; left:0.0000%;\"></div><div class=\"creature-resistance-pct\" style=\"position:absolute; right:calc(5px + 0.0000%); display:inline-block;\">100%</div></div></div>\n<div class=\"creature-resistance-el\" data-value=\"1.0000\" title=\"Drown\"><div class=\"creature-resistance-label\">Drown <span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img alt=\"Drowning Icon Big\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"16\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Drowning_Icon_Big_f65e47.gif\" width=\"16\"/></span></span></div><div class=\"creature-resistance-bar1\"><div class=\"creature-resistance-bar2\" style=\"border-width:1px 1px 1px 1px; width:100.0000%; background-color:#ffffff; left:0.0000%;\"></div><div class=\"creature-resistance-pct\" style=\"position:absolute; right:calc(5px + 0.0000%); display:inline-block;\">100%</div></div></div>\n<div class=\"creature-resistance-el\" data-value=\"1.0000\" title=\"Healing\"><div class=\"creature-resistance-label\">Healing <span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img alt=\"Healing Icon\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"16\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Healing_Icon_be4df6.gif\" width=\"16\"/></span></span></div><div class=\"creature-resistance-bar1\"><div class=\"creature-resistance-bar2\" style=\"border-width:1px 1px 1px 1px; width:100.0000%; background-color:#ffffff; left:0.0000%;\"></div><div class=\"creature-resistance-pct\" style=\"position:absolute; right:calc(5px + 0.0000%); display:inline-block;\">100%</div></div></div>\n</div><div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n</div>\n<div id=\"w-creature-location\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Location\">Location</span></h3>\n<p><a href=\"#/wiki/Stampor%20Cave\">Stampor Cave</a> on the <a href=\"#/wiki/Muggy%20Plains\">Muggy Plains</a> (<a class=\"coord-link\" data-coord=\"33164,31212,7\" title=\"Ver no mapa\">here (33164, 31212, 7)</a>), <a href=\"#/wiki/Chyllfroest\">Chyllfroest</a>.\n</p>\n</div>\n<div id=\"w-creature-behaviour\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Behaviour\">Behaviour</span></h3>\n<p>\tThis creature changes target easily and can swap back just as fast. Blocker/shooter teamhunts are discouraged due to their erratic behavior.<br/><br/>A stampor attacks in melee range.\n</p>\n</div>\n<div id=\"w-creature-strategy\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Strategy\">Strategy</span></h3>\n<p>\tMages: Can hunt them from level 80 and above.<br/>\n<a href=\"#/wiki/Sorcerer\">Sorcerers</a> should use <a href=\"#/wiki/Wand%20of%20Voodoo\">Wand of Voodoo</a> and <a href=\"#/wiki/Druid\">Druids</a>, Springsprout Rod in combination with Earth Strike. Be careful as they can come in groups of two, keep Exura Gran ready incase you need it. Another strategy, if you are a Mage, is to lure 4-6 Stampors and kill them using <a href=\"#/wiki/Stone%20Shower%20Rune\">Stone Shower Runes</a>, this is recommended for Druids/Sorcerers above level 110. You do not need to stand diagonal in order to avoid any waves although, their <a href=\"#/wiki/Berserk\">Berserk</a> may cause a lot damage, it is advised to keep some distance. In the cave you will walk slow because of the bad ground so when there are many use Strong Haste to outrun them. \n<a href=\"#/wiki/Knight\">Knights</a> and <a href=\"#/wiki/Paladin\">Paladins</a> should not hunt these monsters due to their skill reduction ability, which is used quite frequently.\n</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<div>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Loot\">Loot</span></h3>\n<p><small><i>Drop rates are estimated based on 23,194 samples <span class=\"loot-stats-link\">(Loot Statistics)</span>.</i></small> <small><i>Colour-coding is applied after 500 samples.</i></small><br/><small><i>Task column indicates items used in delivery tasks.</i></small>\n</p>\n<table clas